Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.80,0:02:37.01,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:44.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（重要建筑即将落成 伍德兰兹购物中心）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.71,0:38:35.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一切才刚刚开始）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我迟到了 又停电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I'm late. The power's out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你一大早叫我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it that you called this extremely early morning meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:03:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,带早餐的却是我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet I'm the one bringing breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是个好人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're a good guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.99,0:03:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实似乎如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}The evidence seems to go in that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.01,0:03:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以后能每天早上见面吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we start meeting in the mornings?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.43,0:03:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我给你带燕麦粥\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can bring you steel- cut oatmeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,问你为什么要见面吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ask you why we're meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让你教我如何建东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can teach me how to build things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.41,0:03:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想成为建筑师吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to be an architect?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.22,0:03:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想确保那些墙不倒下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to make sure those walls stay up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得它们会倒下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think they could fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得可能被撞到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they could get knocked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是多年以后 我跟你一般年纪时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be years from now, could be when I'm your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.76,0:03:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我一般年纪时我还会在啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll still be around when you're my age.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我跟你学点建筑知识也无妨嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it wouldn't hurt if I knew some of what you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.51,0:03:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何建墙 房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the walls, the houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,新建筑之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some new buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.41,0:04:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想长住？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're in it for the long haul?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在写什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you writing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.39,0:04:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢记下一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I write everything down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything of note.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.98,0:04:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在该你记了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.83,0:04:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有很多要记住的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gonna be a lot to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的一切才刚刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the beginning of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该记下一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should record all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.87,0:05:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我要教你的一切建筑知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with everything I'm gonna teach you about building things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.55,0:05:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不用 谢谢 - 拿着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no, thank you. - Just take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.64,0:05:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你必须保护自己 - 我又不用去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, you got to protect yourself. - Not if I don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大老远开车出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not driving all that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是为了带着错误的垃圾回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we can just drive back with the wrong shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一打这玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a dozen of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.15,0:05:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是哪家造的 外形都差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are consistent in appearance across manufacturers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会带对东西的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shit will be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.41,0:05:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会安装所谓的垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will install said shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后电网会重新运转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the grid will be fully operational again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.81,0:06:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你昨晚跟霍莉聊了聊 她是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard you talking to Holly last night. What's her story?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要问？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.69,0:06:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没什么原因 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No reason. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就随口一问 别逼我揍你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an innocent question. Don't make me hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都带好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.05,0:06:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,急救箱 黄页\N{\fnArial\fs30}First aid kits, yellow pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦列出了清单 我发誓我们没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn made a checklist. We're good, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.13,0:06:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我只是喜欢担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm just a worrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才建起了那堵围住我们的墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how that wall wound up around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.75,0:06:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.35,0:06:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话应该我对你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to be saying that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.63,0:06:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都带上了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.13,0:06:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 全好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - All set?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.65,0:06:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,电网只是个雏形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power grid was a prototype.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,能撑这么久才出问题我已经很意外了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised it took this long to start acting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.36,0:06:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会让它重新运转的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get it going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不早了 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daylight's burning. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我之前说过 但是 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I said it before, but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.57,0:07:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 她是怎么回事啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, seriously, though, what's her story?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒 又是一首混音歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, another mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're going die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以引走行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helps draw them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.71,0:07:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 也许有人不喜欢猫头鹰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe somebody doesn't like owls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人进来搞了破坏吗？- 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone came in here and did this? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.92,0:08:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里从没发生过这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff like this never happens here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么敌人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got any enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.15,0:08:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道有谁厌恶猫头鹰吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know anybody who hates owls?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真遗憾这里没人能调查这种事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad there isn't somebody who could look into this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.77,0:08:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会四处问问的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll ask around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.03,0:08:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.45,0:08:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就算你找出了做这事的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so you find the person who did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.56,0:08:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,又能怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.91,0:08:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有某种后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.05,0:08:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听过「破窗理论」吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever heard about the Broken Window Theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.95,0:09:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,归结起来就是 你保持窗户完整无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boils down to this… you keep the windows intact,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能保持社会稳定无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}you keep society intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是猫头鹰不是窗户 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was an owl, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.99,0:09:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.72,0:09:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天总得干点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to do something today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.06,0:09:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那边就是了吗？- 那就是仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it there? - That's the warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去从那扇门进出是最快的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like that door is our fastest way in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.82,0:09:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先我们应该查看所有出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should know all the exits first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.24,0:09:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果情况有变 就有应变计划了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there's a plan if things go south.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经有计划了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是「从前门出来」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called Going Out the Front.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.12,0:09:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚 当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah, heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你的准头啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you with the aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.10,0:09:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦说得没错 我们应该检查一下周边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn's right, we should do a perimeter check.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.10,0:09:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,查看出口 以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know our exits just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.17,0:10:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要提前声明 我不该来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're aware, I'm on record as stating that I should not be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.09,0:10:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道我不会战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You well know that I'm not combat ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至没有战斗的意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}or even for that matter combat inclined.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,船到桥头自然直\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never are till you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得开始出力了 我就是这样做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got to start pulling your weight. You know, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,公平地说 我认为我出过力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All things being equal, I do believe my weight's been pulled.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.01,0:10:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你们带到了华盛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you all to DC,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.62,0:10:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,以鄙人之见\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, in this man's opinion,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.69,0:10:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在如今的标准下 我已经救赎了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}is damn near nirvana by current standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你没带我们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except you didn't get us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们把你带来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但假如不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But were it not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,提到这座城市有安家的潜力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my mention of this city's potential for home and hearth,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们中没有一个人有远见来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a one of you would have had the vision to come here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.45,0:10:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别提有胆量历尽千辛万苦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}let alone the cojones to travail such a fraught and punishing pilgrimage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.14,0:10:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是事实 妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that, sister, is a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.09,0:10:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷冰冰的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's as cold and hard as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.71,0:10:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 你真这么孬种吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, you're really that much of a coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.84,0:11:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我就是 我说过我是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am. I told you I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.43,0:11:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚准头不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was good aim back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.13,0:11:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,打靶练习挺管用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target practice helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实上周我差点就拿艾登当靶子练了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, last week, I was pretty close to practicing on Aiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.50,0:11:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.31,0:11:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能从前门出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not getting out the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.14,0:11:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it another second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.07,0:12:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a big place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.44,0:12:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面可能有行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There could be some inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.05,0:12:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算里面有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's say they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们行动 注意安全就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move. Let's be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塔拉 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tara. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.60,0:12:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没问题吧？- 这条道交给我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got it? - I got this aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.43,0:13:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们被某物困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're stuck behind something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.91,0:13:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它们不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they aren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.63,0:13:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.31,0:14:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安全 - 安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clear. - Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.38,0:14:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真有经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.80,0:14:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在外漂泊了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were out there a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.46,0:14:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能还有更多行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There could be more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.59,0:14:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开工吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.07,0:14:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.76,0:14:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 我们找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - We found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.44,0:14:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又一个 - 好样的 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here's another. - All right, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.09,0:15:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它穿着防弹衣呢 让它走近点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got armor. Let it come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.59,0:15:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾登 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aiden, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.62,0:15:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.25,0:15:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.89,0:16:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚？塔拉？尤金？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah? Tara? Eugene?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You good? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,笼子开了 行尸出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cage is open. They're getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.14,0:16:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得去找… - 这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to find… - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还有呼吸吗？尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she breathing? Eugene!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,离得太远 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I can't tell from right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们越来越近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.55,0:17:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金 你干掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene, it's yours. Take it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那个办公室 我去救塔拉 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to that office. I'll get Tara. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.77,0:17:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.07,0:17:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没跟别人提枪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't tell anybody about the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.41,0:17:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我发誓 - 回答我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I swear to God. - Answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.78,0:17:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有饼干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any more cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.67,0:17:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,派对上你做的那些饼干？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones you made for the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没了 赶快走 回家去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone. Now go. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家没电\N{\fnArial\fs30}My house doesn't have power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来要去给猫头鹰雕像上色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to paint my owl statue,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.98,0:17:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有人把它打碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but somebody broke it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是无关紧要的小事 山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of these are problems, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎你家怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care about your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你的雕像也不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care about your statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能再做些饼干吗？- 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you make more cookies? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.45,0:18:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么不能？- 因为我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - Because I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以教我怎么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if you showed me how to make them,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.47,0:18:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以自己做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I could do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要吃饼干？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 你得去奥利维亚那里偷巧克力\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You're gonna have to steal the chocolate from Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.90,0:18:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要多给我偷一块\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you're gonna get an extra bar for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你被抓到了 把我供出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you get caught or you say anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定对你不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not gonna like what happens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.88,0:18:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她怎么样了？- 她的头部受到重创\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's she doing? - She has serious head trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 失血过快 - 怎么才能止血？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's losing blood fast. - How do we stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,急救箱在艾登的背包里 已经被炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Med kit was in Aiden's pack. It got blown to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.86,0:18:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,货车里还有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another one in the van.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.01,0:18:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她快不行了 我们得抬她过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's on her way out. We need to get her there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.70,0:18:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们抬她过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll get her there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.81,0:18:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 来人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.91,0:18:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.79,0:18:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还活着吗？- 我检查了 我以为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's alive? - I checked him. I… I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:19:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得去救他 - 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've got to get him. - Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.82,0:19:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,最少要三个人才能救下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna take at least three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.35,0:19:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有那么多时间吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got that kind of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.35,0:19:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算把艾登拉下来 他也可能伤重而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pull Aiden off there, we could kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.09,0:19:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你想扔下他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying we leave him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.20,0:19:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会挺下来的 我知道她会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd do it. I know she would.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留下陪她 保护她 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay with her. I'll keep her safe, I assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.62,0:19:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.66,0:19:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们击退它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll knock them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还有信号弹吗？- 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You still have that flare? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朝那边的架子打信号弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fire the flare over the shelves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.35,0:19:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一部分行尸会被吸引过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll draw some of them over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 剩下的我们徒手杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're gonna hit the rest hand to hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？- 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ready? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.90,0:19:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.23,0:19:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.59,0:19:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,托宾真的认为这要花四周吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tobin really think this'll take four weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:19:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.91,0:20:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次围墙拓张 花了两倍的时间呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time they expanded the wall, it took 'em twice that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我顶会儿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey you…you okay to hang tight?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.91,0:20:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去送份「急件」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to send a fax to Cleveland.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.74,0:21:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家退到卡车里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, back till we're safe in the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.31,0:21:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗辛怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Francine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.96,0:21:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.57,0:21:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.73,0:21:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up and in. You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.23,0:22:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.56,0:22:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亚伯拉罕 - 当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Abraham. - Heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.63,0:22:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你掩护外围\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take out the ass end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.71,0:22:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对付面前这群丑八怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the uglies in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.10,0:22:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 排好队\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Single file.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.73,0:22:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.85,0:22:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害羞 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be shy. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.69,0:22:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.05,0:22:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 那家伙还活着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, son of a bitch is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.07,0:22:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保他活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making sure he stays that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.21,0:22:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 我在喝啤酒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rick, just having a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.46,0:22:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便送你一瓶 感谢你今天帮我老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I'd bring you one for helping my wife today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.00,0:22:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喝 但是很感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good, but thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 别告诉我你还没下班呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, don't tell me you're still on duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.75,0:23:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不能放松警惕 你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of always am, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.23,0:23:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪安娜的派对上除外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at Deanna's party.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.86,0:23:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.81,0:23:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那喝了酒 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had some, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.28,0:23:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望今天我能多帮些忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I wish I could have helped out more today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.71,0:23:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我四处问了问 但大家没发现什么异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked around, but nobody saor heard anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.21,0:23:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是只猫头鹰而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it was just an owl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.25,0:23:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于现在的情况 这不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grand scheme of things, I think we'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.83,0:23:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.20,0:23:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.33,0:23:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你妻子不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard you lost your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.99,0:23:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.89,0:23:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 看起来好像我们好像没失去过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it looks like we haven't lost much,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.94,0:23:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们失去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.52,0:23:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.64,0:24:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们非常努力地去保住剩下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other things we're just fighting like hell to hold on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.38,0:24:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们经历过那么多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you people have been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.69,0:24:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你们有没有同感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.57,0:24:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.45,0:24:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你的孩子们来体检吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring your kids in for a checkup.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.49,0:24:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我让你来过 但他们也该来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I offered you one, but they really should come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.20,0:24:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在外面有一段时间了 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were out there a while, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.32,0:24:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 谢谢 皮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Thanks, Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.74,0:24:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,交个朋友吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's be friends, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.17,0:24:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须做朋友 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kind of have to be, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.47,0:24:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.35,0:24:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.24,0:24:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.89,0:25:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take no responsibility for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.70,0:25:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我是什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you what I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.62,0:25:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该听进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.71,0:25:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人都应该听进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you, you should've listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.87,0:26:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 我们会救你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay. We're gonna get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.69,0:26:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? Everything's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.93,0:26:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须保持安静 好吗？能做到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to stay quiet, okay? Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.25,0:26:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.38,0:26:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.79,0:26:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.85,0:26:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.74,0:26:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快熄灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's burning out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.59,0:26:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.87,0:26:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们做不到的 - 我们肯定能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not gonna make this. - Hey, yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.25,0:26:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要你的帮助 你可以做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need your help. You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.16,0:26:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克 不 不要扔下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick. Nick, don't… don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.92,0:26:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.79,0:26:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 好的 - 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. Okay. - Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.28,0:26:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你扔下了他们 我们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left them. We both did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.83,0:26:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.64,0:27:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.60,0:27:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.05,0:27:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.19,0:27:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it was… it was us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.93,0:27:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前的其他人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others before…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.89,0:27:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有惊慌 是我们惊慌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't panic. We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.08,0:27:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.78,0:27:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.91,0:27:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.74,0:27:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这么干的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That how it works with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.39,0:27:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,弃他人于不顾 让人等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave people behind to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.54,0:28:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一套规矩 告诉他 弗兰辛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a system. Tell him, Francine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.05,0:28:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.77,0:28:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,人渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.86,0:28:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么大动静会吸引更多行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, all that noise is bound to draw more.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.84,0:28:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天到此为止 明早再来 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we call it and start fresh in the morning, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.67,0:28:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的 弗兰辛 你可以继续吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw that. Francine, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.00,0:28:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,离天黑至少还有三个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got at least three hours of daylight left.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.82,0:28:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要两个望风的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want two lookouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.63,0:28:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人在铲斗里 一个人在卡车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}One in the bucket and one on the trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.33,0:28:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果更多的行尸向我们袭来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should give us more than enough warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.69,0:28:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能得到足够的预警了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if more are coming after the bash and pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.75,0:28:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍拍你们屁股上的蜘蛛网 给我动起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now pull the cobwebs out of your ass and move.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.83,0:28:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得盖一堵墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a wall to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.96,0:28:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼古拉斯 站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicholas, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.95,0:28:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冲不出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! You'll never make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.04,0:28:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.42,0:28:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.01,0:29:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.55,0:29:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你请辞我们很遗憾 托宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to lose you, Tobin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.33,0:29:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗？- 我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure? - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.41,0:29:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果亚伯拉罕听从了我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Abraham had followed my orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.23,0:29:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.59,0:29:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽说他因救人而成为英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, saving someone's life makes them a hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.54,0:29:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但并不意味着他有足够的资质管理施工人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it doesn't qualify them to run a construction crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.71,0:29:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们依然在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're still out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.40,0:29:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个团队依旧在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}still working, the whole team.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.27,0:29:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带领着他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's leading them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.80,0:29:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我以前强多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than I ever could.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.62,0:29:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it's settled, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.17,0:29:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕回来之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll speak to Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.09,0:30:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他谈谈 正式任命他\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he's back and make it official.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.70,0:30:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.08,0:30:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 迪安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Deanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.48,0:30:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.96,0:30:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不会后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you won't regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.81,0:30:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的没错 你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.95,0:30:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕的能力绝对足以胜任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham's more than qualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.53,0:30:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你团队的另一个人手握大权\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put another one of your people in a position of power,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.90,0:30:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为他们做担保\N{\fnArial\fs30}you vouch for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.60,0:30:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经变成惯例了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's becoming a pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.96,0:30:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道自己在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.96,0:31:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你把我们留在这里的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why you wanted us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.25,0:31:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是亚伦和达里尔在外面寻找更多的人的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why Aaron and Daryl are out there looking for more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.18,0:31:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望有个未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.42,0:31:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我们与你共创未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need us for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.53,0:31:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.31,0:31:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我继续去写耕地计划了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go get back to work on those field plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.89,0:31:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我随后就来 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be down in a minute. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.24,0:31:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些烤好后就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After these are done, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.88,0:31:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再帮你了 你也不要再来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not helping you again and you're not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.76,0:31:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.71,0:31:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你没想要带走一半多的饼干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're not expecting to leave with more than half of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.14,0:31:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才干了那么点活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You barely did half the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.22,0:31:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前是个好厨师吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you always a good cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.54,0:31:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 我们不要说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, we're not talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.44,0:32:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,擦台面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wipe the counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.56,0:32:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢做菜吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you like it? Cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.28,0:32:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, before.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.86,0:32:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.19,0:32:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不必交朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.65,0:32:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要不沉默就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just doesn't have to be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.81,0:32:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前很会做菜 那能分散我的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was good at it. It distracted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.77,0:32:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我忘记我的伤心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It made me forget when I was sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.47,0:32:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我伤心的时候 会砸东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes when I get sad, I break stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.65,0:32:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.07,0:32:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说有人砸了你的猫头鹰雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said somebody broke your owl statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.18,0:32:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自己砸的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you break it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.76,0:32:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.37,0:32:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么来这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.97,0:32:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要偷枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you steal the guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.66,0:33:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有时你得保护自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because sometimes you need to protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.97,0:33:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给我一把吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.40,0:33:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么想要枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.28,0:33:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是为了我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.89,0:33:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是为了谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.13,0:33:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 是为了谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, who's it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.11,0:33:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.65,0:33:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们可以杀出一条血路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, maybe… maybe we can shoot our way past them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.28,0:33:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们还有枪 - 弹药在你那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You guys still have guns. - And you have the ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.51,0:33:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得想点办法 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to do something, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.67,0:33:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会死在这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna die in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.13,0:33:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有别的办法 一定有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be another way. There was to be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.51,0:34:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.09,0:34:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,来咬我呀 来咬我呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come get me. Come get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.99,0:34:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.52,0:34:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来咬我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.23,0:34:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 尤金 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Eugene. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.23,0:34:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.56,0:34:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们俩 听我说 尼古拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you both… hey, Nicholas!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.13,0:34:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们俩一起稳住门 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you both to keep the door steady, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.01,0:34:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来砸玻璃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna break the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.80,0:34:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一出去 你就推出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get out, you push out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.13,0:34:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到枪就没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get the rifle and we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.71,0:34:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.94,0:34:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.97,0:35:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 住手 这样不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, stop! It's not safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.74,0:35:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只能这样 - 不 砸不破的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is the only way. - No, it's not gonna break.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.86,0:35:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,会的 我们稳得住 可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will. We can hold it. We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.64,0:35:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我好吗？数到三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, okay? Count of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.80,0:35:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,数到三 一 二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count of three. One, two…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.69,0:35:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.25,0:35:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼古拉斯 尼古拉斯 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicholas! Nicholas, don't! Nicholas!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.15,0:35:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 尼古拉斯 别这样 - 尼古拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn it, Nicholas, no! - Nicholas!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.69,0:35:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.51,0:35:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 别放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Don't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.80,0:35:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚 诺亚 诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah! Noah! Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.51,0:35:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.96,0:36:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move over. We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.57,0:36:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,回车上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back in the van.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.29,0:36:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你告诉我他们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until you tell me where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.99,0:36:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要么跟我一起回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either you come back with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.17,0:36:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么留在这里陪你朋友一起死\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you stay here and you die with your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.93,0:36:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,由你决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are your choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.83,0:37:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我把他关到后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me get him in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.22,0:37:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.82,0:37:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 是卡萝尔对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Carol, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.03,0:37:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.56,0:37:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.97,0:37:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉不适吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not feeling well?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.94,0:37:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前跟山姆在一起 他没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was with Sam earlier. Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.65,0:37:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能有什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.70,0:38:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能和杰茜谈谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to Jessie?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.62,0:38:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.68,0:38:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.99,0:38:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百利 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.11,0:38:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.26,0:38:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 进来吧 - 私下谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come… come in. - Privately.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.79,0:38:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.51,0:38:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satan…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.87,0:39:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,以天使之光伪装自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}he disguises himself as the angel of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.91,0:39:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心虚假之光已经进入了墙内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid that false light is here inside these walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.50,0:39:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你的社区不是天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your community, you say it's not a paradise,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.47,0:39:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这里就是天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.51,0:39:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,能来到这里我很感激 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm grateful to be here. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.88,0:39:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你让其他人进来是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you made a mistake letting in the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.45,0:39:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.79,0:39:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.66,0:39:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}his group…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.84,0:39:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're not good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.72,0:39:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们做过一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've done things.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.92,0:39:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们做过坏透了的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've done unspeakable things.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.28,0:39:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特在打杰茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete's hitting Jessie.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.91,0:39:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许也打了山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Sam, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.95,0:40:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,像他们那样在外面生存那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make it out there as long as they did,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.83,0:40:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们必须做一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}they must have done things.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.42,0:40:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克自己也说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick said as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.90,0:40:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们生存了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.19,0:40:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what makes them assets.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.86,0:40:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.76,0:40:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能信任他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.30,0:40:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.16,0:40:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许以为他们做那些事是身不由己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may believe that they did what they had to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.62,0:40:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很害怕 所以他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they were afraid and so they…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.31,0:40:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.38,0:40:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总有一天 - 我们今天进展很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The day will come… - We made a damn good dent today.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.91,0:40:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会把自己的性命放在你们之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they'll put their own lives before yours and everyone else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.35,0:40:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后摧毁你们这里的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they will destroy everything you have here,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.77,0:40:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁你们努力建立的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything you're working so hard to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.26,0:40:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你们早点睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you all call it an early night.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.56,0:40:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this how?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.87,0:40:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆告诉你的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.26,0:40:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不用说我也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.48,0:40:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么现在才告诉我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you just now coming to me with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.04,0:40:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satan,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.24,0:40:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,以天使之光伪装自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}he disguises himself as the angel of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.17,0:41:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的仆人是正义的假使徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}His servants are the false apostles of righteousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.28,0:41:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不配来这里 他们不配来天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't deserve this. They don't deserve paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.20,0:41:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 加百列\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.75,0:41:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a lot to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.32,0:41:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.73,0:41:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望自己能早点来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only wish I'd come to you sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.79,0:41:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.93,0:41:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望不算太迟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope it isn't too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.02,0:41:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人啊 我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! I need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.06,0:41:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.76,0:41:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道该怎么处理皮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how this is gonna go with Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.10,0:42:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一种办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way it can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.17,0:42:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to kill him.
